{"title":"P12278 - P12278 [蓝桥杯 2024 国 Python A] 设置密码 - 洛谷","slug":"2026-05-20-P12278-P12278-蓝桥杯-2024-国-Python-A-设置密码-洛谷","date":"2026-05-19T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-20T02:49:30.929Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-05-20-P12278-P12278-蓝桥杯-2024-国-Python-A-设置密码-洛谷.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"算法名称：P12278-密码强度检测\"><a href=\"#算法名称：P12278-密码强度检测\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法名称：P12278 密码强度检测\"></a>算法名称：P12278 密码强度检测</h2><h3 id=\"核心优化技巧\"><a href=\"#核心优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心优化技巧\"></a>核心优化技巧</h3><p>在处理密码强度检测问题时，我们首先需要理解题目的要求和输入输出格式。本题要求我们编写一个函数，该函数接收一个字符串作为输入，并返回该字符串的密码强度。密码强度由以下条件决定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>长度至少为6个字符</li>\n<li>包含大写字母</li>\n<li>包含小写字母</li>\n<li>包含数字</li>\n<li>包含特殊字符</li>\n</ul>\n<p>我们将使用Python语言来解决这个问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"解题思路\"><a href=\"#解题思路\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"解题思路\"></a>解题思路</h3><h4 id=\"1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 问题分析\"></a>1. 问题分析</h4><p>首先，我们需要明确题目的要求。根据题目描述，我们需要检查输入的字符串是否满足上述五个条件。如果满足，则认为该字符串是有效的密码；否则，认为该字符串是无效的密码。</p>\n<h4 id=\"2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 算法原理\"></a>2. 算法原理</h4><p>我们可以使用Python中的<code>re</code>模块来实现这个功能。<code>re</code>模块提供了正则表达式的功能，可以帮助我们方便地匹配和处理字符串。</p>\n<h4 id=\"3-数学推导（如适用）\"><a href=\"#3-数学推导（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 数学推导（如适用）\"></a>3. 数学推导（如适用）</h4><p>由于题目没有给出具体的数学推导过程，我们在这里不进行详细的数学推导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"4-多种解法对比（如适用）\"><a href=\"#4-多种解法对比（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 多种解法对比（如适用）\"></a>4. 多种解法对比（如适用）</h4><p>对于这个问题，有多种可能的解法。例如，我们可以使用循环遍历字符串，检查每个字符是否满足条件。这种方法的时间复杂度为O(n)，空间复杂度也为O(n)。另一种方法是使用正则表达式，这种方法的时间复杂度为O(n)，空间复杂度也为O(n)。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码详解\"><a href=\"#代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码详解\"></a>代码详解</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> re</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">check_password_strength</span>(<span class=\"params\">st</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;&quot;判断密码强度，返回对应的数字&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 先检查是否只有合法字符</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    valid_chars = <span class=\"built_in\">set</span>([])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> c <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> st:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> c.isalnum():  <span class=\"comment\"># 非字母或数字</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">continue</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> c.isupper():</span><br><span class=\"line\">            valid_chars.add(c.upper())</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> c.islower():</span><br><span class=\"line\">            valid_chars.add(c.lower())</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> c.isdigit():</span><br><span class=\"line\">            valid_chars.add(c)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:  <span class=\"comment\"># 特殊字符</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            valid_chars.add(special_chars[c])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 强密码判断</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(st) &gt;= <span class=\"number\">12</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        has_up = has_lowercase(st)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        has_low = has_digits(st)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        has_spec = has_special_chars(st)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        spec_count = <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(has_spec)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 条件1：包含大写、小写、数字、特殊字符</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> has_up <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> has_low <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> has_dig <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> spec_count &gt;= <span class=\"number\">1</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">3</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 条件2：包含包括特殊字符在内的三种字符类型，且特殊字符种类数&gt;=3</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> spec_count &gt;= <span class=\"number\">3</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> count_char_types(st) &gt;= <span class=\"number\">3</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">3</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 中密码判断</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(st) &gt;= <span class=\"number\">8</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        char_types = count_char_types(st)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> char_types &gt;= <span class=\"number\">2</span>:  <span class=\"comment\"># 至少包含两种字符类型</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 弱密码判断</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(st) &gt;= <span class=\"number\">6</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span>  <span class=\"comment\"># 不合法</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"复杂度分析\"></a>复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(n)，其中n为字符串的长度。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(n)，用于存储合法字符集和计数器。</li>\n</ul>\n","more":"<h2 id=\"算法名称：P12278-密码强度检测\"><a href=\"#算法名称：P12278-密码强度检测\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法名称：P12278 密码强度检测\"></a>算法名称：P12278 密码强度检测</h2><h3 id=\"核心优化技巧\"><a href=\"#核心优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心优化技巧\"></a>核心优化技巧</h3><p>在处理密码强度检测问题时，我们首先需要理