ine\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> re</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">check_password_strength</span>(<span class=\"params\">st</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;&quot;判断密码强度，返回对应的数字&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 先检查是否只有合法字符</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    valid_chars = <span class=\"built_in\">set</span>([])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> c <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> st:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> c.isalnum():  <span class=\"comment\"># 非字母或数字</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">continue</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> c.isupper():</span><br><span class=\"line\">            valid_chars.add(c.upper())</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> c.islower():</span><br><span class=\"line\">            valid_chars.add(c.lower())</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> c.isdigit():</span><br><span class=\"line\">            valid_chars.add(c)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:  <span class=\"comment\"># 特殊字符</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            valid_chars.add(special_chars[c])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 强密码判断</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(st) &gt;= <span class=\"number\">12</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        has_up = has_lowercase(st)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        has_low = has_digits(st)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        has_spec = has_special_chars(st)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        spec_count = <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(has_spec)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 条件1：包含大写、小写、数字、特殊字符</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> has_up <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> has_low <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> has_dig <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> spec_count &gt;= <span class=\"number\">1</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">3</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 条件2：包含包括特殊字符在内的三种字符类型，且特殊字符种类数&gt;=3</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> spec_count &gt;= <span class=\"number\">3</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> count_char_types(st) &gt;= <span class=\"number\">3</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">3</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 中密码判断</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(st) &gt;= <span class=\"number\">8</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        char_types = count_char_types(st)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> char_types &gt;= <span class=\"number\">2</span>:  <span class=\"comment\"># 至少包含两种字符类型</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 弱密码判断</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(st) &gt;= <span class=\"number\">6</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span>  <span class=\"comment\"># 不合法</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"复杂度分析\"></a>复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(n)，其中n为字符串的长度。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(n)，用于存储合法字符集和计数器。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P12278","path":"api/tags/P12278.json"}]}